s://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103675 ?\n\n\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c3be399e-b622-4d71-a802-541ab10b01cd)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create model in Blender\n- Make some faces with a slight angle\n- Set material with high metallic\n- Export model as glb\n- Import model in Godot 4.4\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nSee attached zip for a 4.3 and 4.4 project: [godot43-44.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19113831/godot43-44.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103722/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103722/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}